{"Title":"An Act relative to the air medal license plate","BillNumber":"H3478","DocketNumber":"HD720","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"SGX1","Name":"Steven George Xiarhos","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SGX1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T11:27:40.91"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"SGX1","Name":"Steven George Xiarhos","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/SGX1","ResponseDate":"2023-01-17T11:27:40.91"},{"Id":"JRO0","Name":"Jacob R. Oliveira","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JRO0","ResponseDate":"2023-02-04T15:36:48.0133333"}],"JointSponsor":null,"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H3478/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Xiarhos of Barnstable, a petition (accompanied by bill, House, No. 3478) of Steven George Xiarhos and Jacob R. Oliveira for legislation to authorize the Registrar of Motor Vehicles to issue a distinctive emblem to be affixed to \"veteran\" plates which identifies the owner as a recipient of the air medal.  Transportation.","DocumentText":"\tSection 2 of chapter 90 of the General Laws, as appearing in the 2018 Official Edition, is hereby amended by inserting after the term “Distinguished Flying Cross” in all instances, and inserting the following words:- Air Medal\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Accompanied","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J27","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J27"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}